### Login first to get token
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test2@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Create a meeting
POST http://localhost:5000/api/meetings
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjZhMWQwYmFhZDY4YTgyN2MzM2JjNGU2ZCIsInJvbGUiOiJpbnZlc3RvciIsImlhdCI6MTc4MDY4NDQ3NiwiZXhwIjoxNzgxMjg5Mjc2fQ.8Ey-XDuzFjeGy0kEvAWi5jIKYPc0R4Yg0iDNaoPpNHo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Investment Discussion",
  "invitee": "6a2316d45455f0e4aa534912",
  "startTime": "2026-06-10T10:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2026-06-10T11:00:00.000Z",
  "notes": "Discussing Series A funding"
}

### Register second user
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Investor User",
  "email": "investor@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "investor"
}
